 {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "excessive iodine intake are the most common cause of hyperthyroidism."}]}, {"id": "body-20709", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-20710", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Tremors", "runs": [{"text": "Tremors"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20711", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Excessive sweating", "runs": [{"text": "Excessive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sweating"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20712", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Smooth velvety skin", "runs": [{"text": "Smooth"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "velvety"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20713", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Fine hair", "runs": [{"text": "Fine"}, {"text": " hair"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "924"}}, {"id": "body-20715", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "A rapid heart rate", "runs": [{"text": "A"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rapid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "heart"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rate"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "857"}}, {"id": "body-20716", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "An enlarged thyroid gland", "runs": [{"text": "An"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enlarged"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thyroid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gland"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "857"}}, {"id": "body-20717", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Frequent bowel movements", "runs": [{"text": "Frequent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bowel"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "movements"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "857"}}, {"id": "body-20720", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-20721", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Baseline complete blood count, including white count with differential, and a liver profile (bilirubin and transaminases)", "runs": [{"text": "Baseline"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "complete"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "count,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "including"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "white"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "count"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "differential,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "liver"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "profile"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(bilirubin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "transaminases)"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "857"}}, {"id": "body-20722", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Differential white blood cell count should be obtained during febrile illness and at the onset of pharyngitis in all patients taking antithyroid medication. Routine monitoring of white blood counts is not recommended", "runs": [{"text": "Differential"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "white"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cell"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "count"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "obtained"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "during"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "febrile"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "illness"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "onset"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pharyngitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "all"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patients taking antithyroid medication. Routine monitoring of white blood counts is not recommended"}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "857"}}, {"id": "body-20723",